  "description": "Desktop-only .NET MAUI controls — system tray / status bar icon (Windows, macOS AppKit + Catalyst, Linux ayatana-appindicator), Visual-Studio-style docking (dockable tool windows, tabbed groups, splitters, auto-hide rails, tear-off floating windows), global hotkeys, the native key sources for in-app keyboard shortcuts on AppKit, GTK4 and Catalyst, and the desktop-window presentation of Shiny's quick entry popup and screen-edge glow, and a NotchView that lives in the MacBook camera notch (macOS).",
